Task: Improve the interest estimate with loan start date and offset
(Phase 3, Tier 1) - INSERTED from user feedback at the checkpoint:
"I want to capture when the loan started ... which will help us calculate
more accurate interest estimates" and "we also have an offset account
which saves us some interest which is also in the system".

